{"seq":5,"slug":"lc0114-flatten-binary-tree","title":"LeetCode 114 二叉树展开为链表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-tree-graph/lc0114-flatten-binary-tree","wordCount":949,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-114-二叉树展开为链表\">LeetCode 114 二叉树展开为链表</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你二叉树的根节点 <code>root</code>，请你将它展开为一个单链表：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>展开后的单链表应该同样使用 <code>TreeNode</code>，其中 <code>right</code> 子指针指向链表中下一个结点，而左子指针始终为 <code>null</code></li>\n<li>展开后的单链表应该与二叉树<strong>前序遍历</strong>顺序相同</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>root = [1,2,5,3,4,null,6]</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>[1,null,2,null,3,null,4,null,5,null,6]</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>root = []</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>[]</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>root = [0]</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>[0]</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>树中结点数在范围 <code>[0, 2000]</code> 内</li>\n<li><code>-100 &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 100</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>进阶：</strong> 你可以使用原地算法（O(1) 额外空间）展开这棵树吗？</p>\n<p>本题要求原地修改树结构，将二叉树「拉平」为只有右子节点的链状结构。关键是在修改指针时不丢失未处理的子树。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><h3 id=\"方法一-后序遍历-逆前序\">方法一：后序遍历（逆前序）</h3><p>前序遍历的顺序是「根→左→右」，如果我们按「右→左→根」的逆序处理，就可以从链表末尾向头部构建。维护一个 <code>prev</code> 指针记录上一个处理的节点，当前节点的 <code>right</code> 指向 <code>prev</code>，<code>left</code> 置空。</p>\n<h3 id=\"方法二-前序遍历-存储\">方法二：前序遍历 + 存储</h3><p>先进行前序遍历收集所有节点，然后按顺序重新连接。简单但需要 O(n) 额外空间。</p>\n<h3 id=\"方法三-morris-式原地展开\">方法三：Morris 式原地展开</h3><p>对于每个节点，如果它有左子树，将左子树的最右节点连接到当前节点的右子树，然后将整个左子树移到右边。这种方法不需要递归或栈。</p>\n<p>步骤：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>如果当前节点有左子树，找到左子树的最右节点</li>\n<li>将最右节点的 <code>right</code> 指向当前节点的 <code>right</code></li>\n<li>将当前节点的 <code>right</code> 指向当前节点的 <code>left</code></li>\n<li>将当前节点的 <code>left</code> 置空</li>\n<li>移动到下一个右子节点</li>\n</ol>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>后序递归</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(h)</td>\n<td>优雅简洁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前序 + 存储</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>直观简单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Morris 式原地</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>最优空间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><h3 id=\"方法一-逆前序递归\">方法一：逆前序递归</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class TreeNode {&#10;  val: number;&#10;  left: TreeNode | null;&#10;  right: TreeNode | null;&#10;  constructor(val?: number, left?: TreeNode | null, right?: TreeNode | null) {&#10;    this.val = val ?? 0;&#10;    this.left = left ?? null;&#10;    this.right = right ?? null;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;function flatten(root: TreeNode | null): void {&#10;  let prev: TreeNode | null = null;&#10;&#10;  const dfs = (node: TreeNode | null): void =&gt; {&#10;    if (node === null) return;&#10;&#10;    dfs(node.right);&#10;    dfs(node.left);&#10;&#10;    node.right = prev;&#10;    node.left = null;&#10;    prev = node;&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  dfs(root);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> flatten</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">root</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dfs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (node </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    dfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node.right);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    dfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node.left);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    node.right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    node.left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prev </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  dfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(root);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"方法二-morris-式原地展开\">方法二：Morris 式原地展开</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function flatten(root: TreeNode | null): void {&#10;  let current = root;&#10;&#10;  while (current !== null) {&#10;    if (current.left !== null) {&#10;      let rightmost = current.left;&#10;      while (rightmost.right !== null) {&#10;        rightmost = rightmost.right;&#10;      }&#10;&#10;      rightmost.right = current.right;&#10;      current.right = current.left;&#10;      current.left = null;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    current = current.right;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> flatten</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">root</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> root;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (current.left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rightmost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.left;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (rightmost.right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        rightmost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rightmost.right;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      rightmost.right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.right;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      current.right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.left;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      current.left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.right;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"执行过程示例\">执行过程示例</h3><p>以 <code>root = [1,2,5,3,4,null,6]</code> 为例，展示 Morris 式原地展开：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"原始树：&#10;    1&#10;   / \\&#10;  2   5&#10; / \\   \\&#10;3   4   6\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>原始树：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   / \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  2   5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> / \\   \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3   4   6</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>current</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>树的状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>左子树最右=4, 4.right=5, 1.right=2, 1.left=null</td>\n<td>1→2→3, 2→4→5→6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>左子树最右=3, 3.right=4, 2.right=3, 2.left=null</td>\n<td>1→2→3→4→5→6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>无左子树，前进</td>\n<td>不变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>无左子树，前进</td>\n<td>不变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>无左子树，前进</td>\n<td>不变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>无左子树，前进到 null</td>\n<td>完成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最终结果：<code>1→2→3→4→5→6</code>，所有 left 为 null。</p>\n<h3 id=\"逆前序递归的执行顺序\">逆前序递归的执行顺序</h3><p>以同一棵树为例，逆前序（右→左→根）的访问顺序为：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"6 → 5 → 4 → 3 → 2 → 1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>6 → 5 → 4 → 3 → 2 → 1</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>访问节点</th>\n<th>prev</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>null</td>\n<td>6.right=null, prev=6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>5.right=6, prev=5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>4.right=5, prev=4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>3.right=4, prev=3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>2.right=3, prev=2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1.right=2, prev=1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>从末尾向头部依次连接，最终形成 <code>1→2→3→4→5→6</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>逆前序递归</th>\n<th>Morris 式原地</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(h)，递归栈</td>\n<td>O(1)，无额外空间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度详解：</strong> Morris 式方法中，虽然每个节点可能被多次访问（一次作为 current，一次在寻找最右节点时），但每条边最多被访问两次，因此总时间仍是 O(n)。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度详解：</strong> 逆前序递归需要 O(h) 的栈空间。Morris 式方法只使用 <code>current</code> 和 <code>rightmost</code> 两个指针，空间 O(1)，满足进阶要求。</p>\n<p>本题综合考察了树的遍历和指针操作能力。Morris 式展开的思路——「将左子树挂到右边，左子树的最右连接原右子树」——是一种非常优雅的原地树变换技巧。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 114 二叉树展开为链表","id":"leetcode-114-二叉树展开为链表"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":3,"text":"方法一：后序遍历（逆前序）","id":"方法一-后序遍历-逆前序"},{"level":3,"text":"方法二：前序遍历 + 存储","id":"方法二-前序遍历-存储"},{"level":3,"text":"方法三：Morris 式原地展开","id":"方法三-morris-式原地展开"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":3,"text":"方法一：逆前序递归","id":"方法一-逆前序递归"},{"level":3,"text":"方法二：Morris 式原地展开","id":"方法二-morris-式原地展开"},{"level":3,"text":"执行过程示例","id":"执行过程示例"},{"level":3,"text":"逆前序递归的执行顺序","id":"逆前序递归的执行顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 105 从前序与中序遍历序列构造二叉树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-tree-graph/lc0105-construct-binary-tree"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 199 二叉树的右视图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-tree-graph/lc0199-binary-tree-right-side-view"}}